      ],
      "after": "邊個"
    },
    {
      "title": "Saying no: 唔 (m4) and 冇 (mou5)",
      "explain": "唔 (m4) goes in front of a verb or adjective: 唔食 (m4 sik6), 唔難 (m4 naan4). For 有 (jau5) 'have', the negative is 冇 (mou5).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "She isn't my big sister.",
